{"id":"634d77c6ddef8bdb","group":"27","path":"27/27-ex-asummablegap.md","title":"A nine-variable 2-asummable nonthreshold function","display":"ex-asummablegap — A nine-variable 2-asummable nonthreshold function","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-ex-asummablegap","aliases":["27-ex-asummablegap"],"display":"ex-asummablegap — A nine-variable 2-asummable nonthreshold function","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-df-kasummable]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.3 Theorem 9.15 proof","source_printed_pages":"416–417","source_pdf_pages":"440–441","verification_status":"source-construction-and-finite-boundary-verification-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-ex-asummablegap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-ex-asummablegap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-asummablegap — A nine-variable 2-asummable nonthreshold function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3dcef588a10bf884\" href=\"?note=3dcef588a10bf884\" title=\"27-df-kasummable\">27-df-kasummable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.3 Theorem 9.15 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"416–417"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"440–441"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-and-finite-boundary-verification-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dcef588a10bf884\" href=\"?note=3dcef588a10bf884\" title=\"27-df-kasummable\">27-df-kasummable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(14,18,24,26,27,30,31,36,37)\">\\(a=(14,18,24,26,27,30,31,36,37)\\)</span>。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^j,Y^j\">\\(X^j,Y^j\\)</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^9\">\\(\\mathbb B^9\\)</span> 中向量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X^1=(1,0,0,0,0,0,1,1,0),\\quad X^2=(0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,1),\\quad X^3=(0,0,1,0,1,1,0,0,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X^1=(1,0,0,0,0,0,1,1,0),\\quad X^2=(0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,1),\\quad X^3=(0,0,1,0,1,1,0,0,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y^1=(1,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,1),\\quad Y^2=(0,1,0,0,1,0,0,1,0),\\quad Y^3=(0,0,1,1,0,0,1,0,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y^1=(1,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,1),\\quad Y^2=(0,1,0,0,1,0,0,1,0),\\quad Y^3=(0,0,1,1,0,0,1,0,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^9\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad f(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;a\\cdot x\\le80\\ \\lor\\ x\\in\\{X^1,X^2,X^3\\},\\\\1&amp;a\\cdot x&gt;80\\ \\land\\ x\\notin\\{X^1,X^2,X^3\\}.\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^9).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f:\\mathbb B^9\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad f(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;a\\cdot x\\le80\\ \\lor\\ x\\in\\{X^1,X^2,X^3\\},\\\\1&amp;a\\cdot x&gt;80\\ \\land\\ x\\notin\\{X^1,X^2,X^3\\}.\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^9).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9\\setminus\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\qquad X^1+X^2+X^3=Y^1+Y^2+Y^3.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9\\setminus\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\qquad X^1+X^2+X^3=Y^1+Y^2+Y^3.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^9\\mid a\\cdot x=81\\}=\\{X^1,X^2,X^3,Y^1,Y^2,Y^3\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^9\\mid a\\cdot x=81\\}=\\{X^1,X^2,X^3,Y^1,Y^2,Y^3\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.15 的 Gabelman 型构造，印刷 pp.416–417／PDF pp.440–441。等长三点和给非阈值见证。若两假点和等于两真点和，得分比较强制四点都在得分81边界，故只须比较允许重复的三X与三Y的各六个二点和；两侧无共同和。已枚举512顶点确认边界恰六点，并核对二点和不相交。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-kasummable","status":"resolved","id":"3dcef588a10bf884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-kasummable]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-kasummable]]。$a=(14,18,24,26,27,30,31,36,37)$。下列 $X^j,Y^j$ 均为 $\\mathbb B^9$ 中向量；$f$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-kasummable","status":"resolved","id":"3dcef588a10bf884","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-kasummable]]。$a=(14,18,24,26,27,30,31,36,37)$。下列 $X^j,Y^j$ 均为 $\\mathbb B^9$ 中向量；$f$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9","display":false},{"tex":"a=(14,18,24,26,27,30,31,36,37)","display":false},{"tex":"X^j,Y^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^9","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"X^1=(1,0,0,0,0,0,1,1,0),\\quad X^2=(0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,1),\\quad X^3=(0,0,1,0,1,1,0,0,0).","display":true},{"tex":"Y^1=(1,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,1),\\quad Y^2=(0,1,0,0,1,0,0,1,0),\\quad Y^3=(0,0,1,1,0,0,1,0,0).","display":true},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^9\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad f(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&a\\cdot x\\le80\\ \\lor\\ x\\in\\{X^1,X^2,X^3\\},\\\\1&a\\cdot x>80\\ \\land\\ x\\notin\\{X^1,X^2,X^3\\}.\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^9).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9\\setminus\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\qquad X^1+X^2+X^3=Y^1+Y^2+Y^3.","display":true},{"tex":"\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^9\\mid a\\cdot x=81\\}=\\{X^1,X^2,X^3,Y^1,Y^2,Y^3\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1917,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-ex-asummablegap|ex-asummablegap — A nine-variable 2-asummable nonthreshold function]]"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5","3dcef588a10bf884"]}